  <notes>
    Blocks 042 (privacy/internal-only/privilege enforcement — R1's highest-risk, security-sensitive task). 042 cannot be authored against an undecided grant primitive.

    Design §5 already resolved the *shape* (record-boundary security; open=ADR-034; private=existing per-record sharing grant). This spike resolves ONLY the *detail* of which existing sharing primitive. Do not reopen the resolved parts.

    ACS membership is a projection (design §4) — whichever primitive wins, task 041's reconcile job must be able to compute the authorized participant set from it. Make that computability an explicit decision axis.
  </notes>

